### Conversation requests — POST /v1/chat
### Spec: docs/03 Contracts/API.md, docs/03 Contracts/Agent Context.md
### Run with: JetBrains HTTP Client or REST Client (VS Code).
### Replace the scoped ids if your local environment uses different test data.

@host = http://localhost:8000
@tenantId = bc1864b0-8dec-4626-b6cf-bfe7659e8bd7
@actorId = 12025b6b-c7f9-4102-aa5a-bb695008acf8
@customerId = 2c314e1a-743f-4e34-854a-75ee7074615a
@conversationId = manual-test-conversation-001
@newTurnIdempotencyKey = 3f1a2b4c-5d6e-4f70-8a91-b2c3d4e5f607
@continueTurnIdempotencyKey = b7e2c1d4-3a55-4a90-9f62-1c8d0e4f2a33


### Start a conversation (new)
### Customer starts a sales conversation through WhatsApp.
### conversation_id null starts a new conversation.
### Tenant, actor, customer, and idempotency headers are required.

POST {{host}}/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Customer-Id: {{customerId}}
X-Idempotency-Key: {{newTurnIdempotencyKey}}

{
  "conversation_id": null,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Boa tarde. Vi os vossos produtos no WhatsApp e gostei de um modelo. Queria saber se ainda têm disponível e quanto está a custar.",
      "links": [],
      "media": []
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "channel": "whatsapp"
  }
}


### Continue an existing conversation
### Customer follows up in the same WhatsApp sales conversation.
### Use a real persisted conversation id when the conversation store is enabled.

POST {{host}}/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-Id: {{actorId}}
X-Customer-Id: {{customerId}}
X-Idempotency-Key: {{continueTurnIdempotencyKey}}

{
  "conversation_id": "{{conversationId}}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "É mesmo este da foto. Ainda têm em stock? E esse preço é o último ou dá para fazer um desconto? Também queria saber se fazem entrega em Luanda.",
      "links": [],
      "media": [
        {
          "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523275335684-37898b6baf30?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
          "type": "image"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "channel": "whatsapp"
  }
}